{"step_index":49,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-13T18:53:47Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"invoke_subagent","args":{"Subagents":[{"Model":"flash","Prompt":"Research: Where to buy refurbished/discounted MacBook Pro with Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3/M4/M5 chips, NOT Intel) with 32GB RAM and 512GB or 1TB storage in India at cheaper prices. Focus on:\n\n1. Apple Certified Refurbished Store India (https://www.apple.com/in/shop/refurbished) - check what's available, pricing, warranty details, AppleCare eligibility\n2. Amazon India refurbished/renewed MacBook Pro listings with Apple Silicon 32GB\n3. Flipkart refurbished/renewed section\n4. Any other legitimate Indian websites selling refurbished Apple Silicon MacBooks (like Cashify, OLX, Quikr, Reebelo, BackMarket India, etc.)\n\nFor each platform, find: actual prices if possible, warranty offered, AppleCare eligibility, return policy, and trustworthiness.\n\nSearch queries to use:\n- \"Apple certified refurbished MacBook Pro India 32GB M4 M3\"\n- \"buy refurbished MacBook Pro 32GB Apple Silicon India 2026\"\n- \"renewed MacBook Pro 32GB Amazon India\"\n- \"BackMarket India MacBook Pro refurbished\"\n- \"Cashify MacBook Pro refurbished India\"\n\nReturn all findings with source URLs and prices in INR.","Role":"Refurbished MacBook India researcher","TypeName":"cheap-macbook-researcher"},{"Model":"flash","Prompt":"Research: Can you buy AppleCare+ for a refurbished or second-hand MacBook Pro in India? What are the rules?\n\nSpecifically find out:\n1. Apple's official policy on AppleCare+ for refurbished Macs bought from Apple Certified Refurbished store\n2. Apple's official policy on AppleCare+ for Macs bought second-hand from third parties\n3. Time limit to purchase AppleCare+ after buying a Mac (new or refurbished)\n4. AppleCare+ pricing for MacBook Pro in India\n5. What AppleCare+ covers vs standard warranty\n6. Any restrictions on buying AppleCare+ for a used Mac\n\nSearch queries:\n- \"AppleCare+ refurbished MacBook Pro India eligibility\"\n- \"buy AppleCare for second hand MacBook India rules\"\n- \"Apple certified refurbished warranty AppleCare India 2026\"\n- \"AppleCare+ MacBook Pro price India 2026\"\n- site:apple.com/in AppleCare MacBook refurbished\n\nReturn findings with source URLs.","Role":"AppleCare refurbished eligibility researcher","TypeName":"cheap-macbook-researcher"},{"Model":"flash","Prompt":"Research: Find websites and platforms where MacBook Pro with Apple Silicon (M-series, NOT Intel) with 32GB RAM can be bought at discounted/cheaper prices in India. Look for:\n\n1. Vijay Sales, Croma, Reliance Digital - any ongoing MacBook Pro deals\n2. Credit card offers/cashback on MacBook Pro purchases in India September 2026\n3. Exchange/trade-in offers that reduce MacBook Pro price significantly\n4. Open-box or display model deals\n5. Apple Premium Partners with better pricing than Apple Store\n6. Any coupon/discount aggregator sites for MacBook deals India\n7. Compare prices across platforms for MacBook Pro M4 Pro 32GB or similar\n\nSearch queries:\n- \"cheapest MacBook Pro 32GB M4 price India September 2026\"\n- \"MacBook Pro deals Vijay Sales Croma India 2026\"\n- \"MacBook Pro M4 Pro discount India best price\"\n- \"open box MacBook Pro India\"\n- \"MacBook Pro exchange offer India 2026\"\n\nReturn findings with source URLs and actual prices in INR where available.","Role":"Discount deals aggregator researcher","TypeName":"cheap-macbook-researcher"}],"toolAction":"Spawning research subagents","toolSummary":"Parallel research agents"}}]}
