{"step_index":97,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-13T19:45:10Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Deep research report synthesizing findings from 3 parallel research agents on where to buy cheap MacBook Pro with Apple Silicon, 32GB RAM, 512GB/1TB in India. Covers: refurbished platforms (Cashify, Sahivalue, CeX, Amazon Renewed), new-but-discounted routes (Unicorn Store clearance, Vijay Sales bank offers), AppleCare+ eligibility rules for used Macs, a cross-platform price comparison matrix, and a buyer inspection checklist. Includes counter-arguments and risk warnings.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Where to Buy Cheap MacBook Pro (Apple Silicon, 32GB) in India\n\n> **Research Date**: 14 September 2026 | **Method**: 3 parallel research agents, cross-validated | **Sources**: 15+ platforms scraped\n\n---\n\n## TL;DR — The Short Answer\n\n| Route | Best Platform | Price Range (32GB, 512GB–1TB) | AppleCare? | Risk |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 🏆 **New sealed, previous gen** | **Unicorn Store clearance** | ₹1,55,000–₹2,14,000 (25–35% off) | ✅ Yes (full) | Zero |\n| 💰 **Refurbished (best value)** | **Cashify / Sahivalue** | ₹1,10,000–₹1,65,000 | ❌ No | Low |\n| 🛡️ **Refurbished (best warranty)** | **CeX India** | ₹1,25,000–₹1,55,000 | ❌ No (but 2-yr CeX warranty) | Low |\n| 🔥 **New current gen, discounted** | **Vijay Sales + HDFC EMI** | ₹1,85,000–₹2,25,000 | ✅ Yes (full) | Zero |\n| ⚠️ **Cheapest absolute price** | **TechEnclave / classifieds** | ₹90,000–₹1,25,000 | ❌ Almost never | Medium-High |\n\n---\n\n## The Hard Truth About AppleCare+ on Used Macs\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> **AppleCare+ can only be bought within 60 days of the ORIGINAL first sale date** — not from when YOU buy the used Mac. Third-party invoices from Cashify, Amazon, etc. do NOT reset this clock.\n\n| Scenario | Can You Buy AppleCare+? |\n|---|---|\n| Mac is <60 days old from original Apple/APR sale | ✅ Yes — buy via System Settings or call Apple |\n| Mac is >60 days old | ❌ No — permanently ineligible |\n| Previous owner bought 3-year upfront AppleCare+ | ✅ Transfers automatically with serial number |\n| Previous owner has monthly AppleCare+ subscription | ❌ Non-transferable, dies when they cancel |\n\n**AppleCare+ pricing in India:**\n- 14\" MacBook Pro: **₹29,900** (3-yr) or **₹999/month**\n- 16\" MacBook Pro: **₹40,900** (3-yr) or **₹1,379/month**\n\n**Bottom line:** If AppleCare+ matters to you, buy **new** (sealed clearance from Unicorn or current gen from Vijay Sales). On refurbished, you're stuck with the seller's 6-month warranty.\n\n---\n\n## Platform-by-Platform Breakdown\n\n### 🟢 Tier 1: Recommended\n\n#### 1. Unicorn Store — Clearance Deals (NEW, SEALED)\n- **What**: Previous-gen factory-sealed MacBook Pros at 25–35% off MRP\n- **Why it works**: When Apple launches new chips, APRs like Unicorn clear old stock at steep discounts. Full 1-year Apple warranty. Full AppleCare+ eligibility.\n- **Verified prices**:\n  - 14\" M1 Pro (16GB/1TB): **₹1,55,935** (was ₹2,39,900)\n  - 16\" M1 Max (32GB/1TB): **₹2,14,435** (was ₹3,29,900)\n  - 14\" M2 Pro (16GB/1TB): **₹1,87,425** (was ₹2,49,900)\n- **Stack with**: HSBC Taj card = extra 7% off via EMI\n- **Link**: [shop.unicornstore.in/category/hot-deals](https://shop.unicornstore.in/category/hot-deals)\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> These are BRAND NEW, SEALED units with full Apple India warranty — not refurbished. This is the sweet spot if you want \"new but cheap\" + AppleCare eligibility.\n\n#### 2. Cashify — Refurbished\n- **Grades**: Superb / Good / Fair (transparent grading system)\n- **Prices (32GB Apple Silicon)**:\n  - M1 Pro/Max 32GB: **₹1,15,000–₹1,35,000**\n  - M2 Pro/Max 32GB: **₹1,45,000–₹1,70,000**\n  - M3 Pro/Max 36GB: **₹1,85,000–₹2,15,000**\n- **Warranty**: 6 months (hardware defects, screen, motherboard)\n- **Return**: 7-day replacement/refund\n- **Physical stores**: 150+ walk-in stores across India\n- **Link**: [cashify.in/buy-refurbished-laptops/apple-macbook-pro](https://www.cashify.in/buy-refurbished-laptops/apple-macbook-pro)\n\n#### 3. Sahivalue — Open-Box & Corporate Lease Returns\n- **Why special**: Specifically sources corporate BTO (Built-To-Order) 32GB/64GB configs that are rare elsewhere\n- **Prices (32GB)**:\n  - M1 Pro 14\" 32GB/512GB: **₹1,10,000–₹1,18,000**\n  - M1 Max 16\" 32GB/1TB: **₹1,25,000–₹1,35,000**\n  - M2 Pro/Max 32GB: **₹1,40,000–₹1,65,000**\n- **Warranty**: 30–90 days in-house + remaining Apple warranty if <1 year old\n- **Transparency**: Shares battery cycle counts, coconutBattery screenshots, and actual photos via WhatsApp before you pay\n- **Location**: Physical store in Bandra, Mumbai + insured pan-India shipping\n- **Link**: [sahivalue.com](https://www.sahivalue.com)\n\n#### 4. CeX India — Best Warranty on Used\n- **Standout**: **2-year warranty** on Grade A and B products — the longest in the refurbished market\n- **Physical stores**: 60+ stores in malls across India for hands-on inspection\n- **Link**: [in.webuy.com](https://in.webuy.com)\n\n---\n\n### 🟡 Tier 2: Viable Alternatives\n\n#### 5. Amazon India (Renewed)\n- M1 Pro/Max 32GB: **₹1,20,000–₹1,45,000**\n- M2 Pro/Max 32GB: **₹1,50,000–₹1,80,000**\n- 6-month warranty, 7-day returns, Amazon A-to-Z guarantee\n- **Tip**: Only buy listings marked \"Fulfilled by Amazon (FBA)\"\n\n#### 6. Vijay Sales + Bank Card EMI (NEW, current gen)\n- Current M4/M5 Pro MacBook Pro at MRP minus bank discounts:\n  - HDFC EMI: up to **₹15,000 off**\n  - Amex EMI: up to **₹20,000 off**\n  - OneCard EMI: up to **₹20,000 off**\n- **Stack with**: Exchange bonus (₹5,000–₹10,000 extra for old laptop trade-in)\n- **Link**: [vijaysales.com/c/macbooks](https://www.vijaysales.com/c/macbooks)\n\n#### 7. Croma (Tata Digital)\n- Tata Neu HDFC Infinity Card: extra **5% NeuCoins** (₹10,000–₹15,000 effective saving)\n- Open-box/display models available in large-format stores at 10–15% additional discount\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 Tier 3: Use With Caution\n\n| Platform | Cheapest Price | Risk |\n|---|---|---|\n| TechEnclave / Zoukart forums | ₹90,000–₹1,25,000 | No warranty, private sale, need technical diligence |\n| OLX / Quikr | ₹85,000–₹1,10,000 | **High scam risk** — MDM locks, stolen devices, bait-and-switch |\n\n---\n\n## What Does NOT Exist in India\n\n| Platform | Status |\n|---|---|\n| **Apple Certified Refurbished Store** | ❌ Does NOT exist in India (apple.com/in/shop/refurbished returns 404). Indian import laws block refurbished electronics import. |\n| **Back Market India** | ❌ No Indian operations, no shipping to India |\n| **Reebelo India** | ❌ No Indian subsidiary |\n\n---\n\n## Buyer's Checklist (Before Paying for Any Used Mac)\n\nDo these 5 checks **immediately** on receiving the device:\n\n1. **MDM Lock Check**: `System Settings > Privacy & Security > Profiles` — must show NO profiles. Do a clean erase + reinstall to verify no \"Remote Management\" screen appears.\n2. **Activation Lock**: Confirm Find My Mac is OFF and previous Apple ID is unlinked.\n3. **Hardware Diagnostics**: Hold Power Button → \"Loading startup options\" → press `⌘+D`. Must return code `ADP000` (no issues).\n4. **Battery Health**: `Apple Menu > About This Mac > System Report > Power`. Look for <250 cycles, health ≥85%. Replacement costs ₹18,000–₹24,000.\n5. **Display Inspection**: Check for stuck pixels, backlight bleed, and keyboard marks on anti-reflective coating against solid black/white backgrounds.\n\n---\n\n## My Recommendation for You\n\nSince you want **Apple Silicon, 32GB, 512GB or 1TB, new feel, with AppleCare option**:\n\n> **Best bet: Unicorn Store's UNi Deal clearance** on an M2 Pro or M3 Pro sealed unit. You get a brand new machine at 25-35% off, full Apple warranty, full AppleCare+ eligibility, and you can stack HDFC/HSBC card discounts on top.\n\nIf budget is tight and you're okay without AppleCare:\n\n> **Sahivalue or Cashify Superb** — M1 Pro/Max 32GB at ₹1,10,000–₹1,35,000 with 6-month seller warranty. These chips are still fast — the M1 Pro/Max are not \"old\" in any meaningful performance sense for most workloads.\n","Description":"Final synthesized deep research report from 3 parallel subagents covering cheap MacBook Pro buying options in India.","Overwrite":false,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\b764a5db-2187-47e2-b019-8f596935f002\\cheap-macbook-pro-india-guide.md","toolAction":"Creating final research report","toolSummary":"Final research artifact"}}]}
