{"step_index":108,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T07:46:46Z","content":"Priyanshu, the ₹29,900 is for **Final Cut Pro**, which is Apple's professional video editing software. \n\n**Why it costs 30k:**\nIt is a professional, industry-standard tool. Unlike Adobe Premiere Pro, which forces you to pay a monthly subscription forever, Apple charges a one-time fee. You pay ₹29,900 once, you own it for life, and you get all future updates for free.\n\n**How it helps:**\n1. **Advanced Video Editing:** It gives you advanced timelines, color grading, audio mixing, and motion graphics tools used by YouTubers and filmmakers to create high-end content.\